    "description": "Showcasing beautiful views across the Maribyrnong River, this light-filled three-bedroom residence delivers an appealing blend of space, comfort, and low-maintenance living in a sought-after Ascot Vale location.<br/><br/>Generously proportioned open-plan living and dining zones create an inviting setting for everyday living and entertaining, complemented by a well-appointed kitchen featuring stone benchtops and a dishwasher. Designed for year-round comfort, the home is enhanced by ducted heating, a downstairs split-system air conditioner, and the added convenience of a central ducted vacuum system.<br/><br/>Accommodation comprises three well-sized bedrooms, with the main bedroom enjoying a walk-in robe and private ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms feature built-in robes. Two contemporary bathrooms showcase floor-to-ceiling tiling, adding a refined finish to the home's practical design.<br/><br/>Further highlights include a remote-controlled single garage with rear roller-door access through to the decked courtyard, providing an ideal space to relax or entertain outdoors.<br/><br/>Positioned along the picturesque Maribyrnong River in a highly regarded pocket of Ascot Vale, this appealing residence offers an enviable lifestyle close to riverside walking and cycling trails, parklands, local cafés, shopping, public transport, and convenient access to the CBD.<br/><br/>Combining scenic river views, generous interiors, and thoughtful modern comforts, this is an excellent opportunity to secure a quality home in a desirable lifestyle location.",
