    "description": "Unlock the potential of 138 acres of prime land at 75 Masons Road, Wollert, located approximately<br/>30 kilometres from Melbourne's CBD. This expansive property offers potential access to the Outer<br/>Metropolitan Ring Road, making it a strategic investment for future development. Currently<br/>designated as Green Wedge Zone, the land presents immense opportunities for rezoning, making<br/>it a fantastic land banking prospect.<br/>Nestled near rapidly developing estates such as Wollert Rise, The Patch, and Riverhills, this site is<br/>perfectly positioned to take advantage of the area's growth. Its close proximity to the Urban Growth<br/>Zone highlights its potential for residential and commercial projects, ideal for meeting the demands<br/>of a growing population.<br/>This property offers a blank canvas for visionary developers and investors. Picture a vibrant<br/>community or innovative agricultural ventures that blend with the natural landscape. With Wollert's<br/>expanding infrastructure and amenities, the future of this land is bright.<br/>don't miss this exceptional opportunity to invest in one of Melbourne's fastest-growing regions.<br/>Whether you're looking to develop or secure a valuable asset for future appreciation, this property<br/>stands out in the market.<br/><br/>Key Investment Highlights<br/>138-Acres of Prime Land<br/>Located Approx. 30 Km North of Melbourne CBD<br/>In the vicinity of major developments such as Wollert Rise, The Patch and Riverhills Estate<br/>Easy Access to Major Roads such as Donnybrook Road, Epping Road and Bridge Inn Road<br/>380m+ of Masons Road Frontage<br/>Close Proximity to UGB<br/>Features Flat Terrain, ideal for future Development<br/>Potential access to Future Outer Metropolitan Ring Road<br/><br/>For further details or to book an inspection, please reach out to Garvit Mediratta (Land Specialist)<br/>on 0433 073 026",
